   "tip": {
    "title": "Father's side or mother's side?",
    "text": "Odia has a different word for each side. Father's side: ଜେଜେ ବାପା, ଜେଜେ ମାଆ, ଦାଦା (father's younger brother), ବଡ଼ ବାପା (father's elder brother), ପିଉସୀ. Mother's side: ଅଜା, ଆଈ, ମାମୁଁ, ମାଉସୀ. So 'uncle' or 'grandma' alone is never enough — choose the side."
   }
